{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If one minus the reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe4bf9c2b96ee54aa7d3e792caf208b6619a5fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> equals the reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe4bf9c2b96ee54aa7d3e792caf208b6619a5fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299226dfe9f8fed96c020e87a552ce6fced86f37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }1/2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe4bf9c2b96ee54aa7d3e792caf208b6619a5fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e440f59888e5fa0ea5a8b27bedb894e0745917f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" />, so our equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff381ea1ef9861150899951ec43cba92a5a1eb86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1-\\frac{1}{1-x}=\\frac{1}{1-x},\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"37\" /> which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77c56c0fb2bf8303000f409e443325178f6e7e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1-x}=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da4dbbd5631821dc90d0494d6eeee7badcdc0ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f07a00ff04d9beaacb34c15d0fdf14e8f6907c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1\\Rightarrow \\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"17\" />.~MathJams\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AHSME\">1977 AHSME</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_A